---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import BlogPostLayout from '../../layouts/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { valleyCenterFavoritesPost as post } from '../../data/blogPosts';
import purpleSpoonPhoto from '../../assets/blog/1-local-guide-valley-center/purple-spoon-storefront-sunset.jpg';
import mclaughlinParkPhoto from '../../assets/blog/1-local-guide-valley-center/valley-center-mclaughlin-park-self-owned.jpg';
import fallFestivalPhoto from '../../assets/blog/1-local-guide-valley-center/fall-festival.jpg';
import fallFestivalParadePhoto from '../../assets/blog/1-local-guide-valley-center/valley-center-fall-festival-parade-truck-self-owned-crop.jpg';

const festival = {
  dates: 'September 25 & 26, 2026',
  annual: '64th Annual Valley Center Fall Festival',
  theme: 'Thriller Nights in the Valley',
  detailsUrl: 'https://valleycenterchamber.com/event/64th-annual-valley-center-fall-festival/',
};
---

<BlogPostLayout
  title={post.title}
  description={post.description}
  subtitle={post.subtitle}
  category={post.category}
  location={post.location}
  author={post.author}
  publishedDate={post.publishedDate}
  displayDate={post.displayDate}
  socialImage={post.socialImage}
  socialImageAlt={post.socialImageAlt}
>
  <section class="blog-article-intro shell" aria-labelledby="favorites-intro-title">
    <div class="blog-intro-copy" data-reveal="up">
      <h2 id="favorites-intro-title" class="eyebrow blog-intro-label">A few hometown favorites</h2>
      <p>I've called Valley Center home for more than 20 years, and it's also where my husband and I raised our girls. Over that time, we've seen new places become part of the community, spent countless afternoons at familiar favorites, and made plenty of memories at the events that bring everyone together each year. Here are a few that have become part of our life in Valley Center.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-entry blog-entry-spoon" aria-labelledby="purple-spoon-title">
    <div class="shell blog-entry-grid" data-reveal="up">
      <div class="blog-entry-media">
        <div class="blog-photo-frame">
          <Picture
            class="blog-article-photo"
            src={purpleSpoonPhoto}
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            widths={[480, 720, 960, 1280, 1536]}
            sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 40vw, 100vw"
            alt="The Purple Spoon sign above Main Street at sunset"
          />
          <p class="blog-photo-credit">Photo courtesy of The Purple Spoon</p>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link blog-source-link" href="https://thepurplespoonvc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit The Purple Spoon's official site <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="blog-entry-copy">
        <p class="blog-entry-number">01 <span>The Purple Spoon</span></p>
        <h2 id="purple-spoon-title">Valley Center has a new reason to make an ice cream run.</h2>
        <p>The Purple Spoon is one of the newer additions to Main Street, and it didn't take long for it to feel like it belonged here. My family and I always find a way to justify a trip there at least once a week! The soft-serve flavors rotate periodically so make sure you ask what the current flavors are.</p>
        <p>One thing I appreciate is how much it feels like Valley Center. A lot of the people behind the counter are local high school students, and they're always friendly and welcoming!</p>

        <div class="blog-fact-list">
          <h3>Worth knowing</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>More than 24 hand-scooped flavors</li>
            <li>Fresh waffle cones made in the shop</li>
            <li>A rotating soft-serve twist</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-entry blog-entry-park" aria-labelledby="mclaughlin-park-title">
    <div class="shell" data-reveal="up">
      <div class="blog-entry-heading">
        <p class="blog-entry-number">02 <span>McLaughlin Park</span></p>
        <h2 id="mclaughlin-park-title">An ordinary afternoon can be the whole plan.</h2>
        <p>McLaughlin Park has been part of our family's Valley Center life for a long time. Our girls grew up going there, we've held birthday parties in the shelter building, and these days I still spend plenty of time walking our Shih Tzu, Charlie, around the pond.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blog-park-grid">
        <div class="blog-park-details">
          <ul class="blog-feature-list">
            <li>Splash pad and playground</li>
            <li>Disc golf</li>
            <li>Pond and walking path</li>
            <li>Shelter for gatherings and birthday parties</li>
          </ul>

          <p>There's a splash pad, playground, and disc golf course, but one thing I like about McLaughlin is that it doesn't have to be a big outing. Sometimes it's just a walk around the pond or a place to spend an hour outside.</p>

          <a class="arrow-link blog-source-link" href="https://www.valleycenterks.gov/departments/parks_and_public_buildings/parks/mclaughlin_park/index.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more about McLaughlin Park <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="blog-entry-media">
          <Picture
            class="blog-article-photo"
            src={mclaughlinParkPhoto}
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            widths={[480, 720, 960, 1224]}
            sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 40vw, 100vw"
            alt="The McLaughlin Park splash pad with its water features running, surrounded by shaded benches, playground equipment, and mature trees"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-entry blog-entry-festival" aria-labelledby="fall-festival-title">
    <div class="shell blog-festival-opening" data-reveal="up">
      <div class="blog-festival-intro">
        <p class="blog-entry-number">03 <span>Valley Center Fall Festival</span></p>
        <h2 id="fall-festival-title">A weekend when Valley Center feels especially like Valley Center.</h2>
        <p>Fall Festival is probably the weekend when Valley Center feels most like home to me. We've been going for years, and one of my favorite parts is seeing Main Street lit up at night, with people gathered all along it. There's something about that evening that always feels special.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-festival-panorama" data-reveal="up">
      <Picture
        class="blog-article-photo"
        src={fallFestivalPhoto}
        formats={['avif', 'webp']}
        widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1672]}
        sizes="100vw"
        alt="Aerial view of carnival rides and crowds at the Valley Center Fall Festival at night"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="shell blog-festival-closing">
      <div class="blog-festival-pairing" data-reveal="up">
        <div class="blog-festival-pairing-copy">
          <p>The parade is one of my favorite parts of the festival weekend. Main Street fills up, there's often a small plane circling overhead, and our girls have even been part of the parade over the years. Breezy, the penguin mascot from Breezy's Snow Shack, and its float are familiar parade sights that have become part of Fall Fest for us. It seems like we run into someone we know every few steps!</p>
          <p>And come hungry. There's usually plenty of festival food, but roasted corn and the root beer stand are two things I associate with Fall Fest. There's also a beer garden that's a good place to stop for a while.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="blog-festival-pairing-media">
          <Picture
            class="blog-article-photo"
            src={fallFestivalParadePhoto}
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            widths={[480, 640, 800, 1200]}
            sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 32vw, 100vw"
            alt="A decorated truck with balloons and a hand-lettered sign waiting in the Valley Center Fall Festival parade lineup"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="blog-event-card" aria-labelledby="festival-date-title">
        <div class="blog-event-summary">
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Save the date</p>
          <p class="blog-event-date" id="festival-date-title">{festival.dates}</p>
          <p class="blog-event-theme">{festival.theme}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="blog-event-details">
          <h3>{festival.annual}</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Saturday morning parade</li>
            <li>Carnival rides and activities</li>
            <li>Food court and beer garden</li>
            <li>Live entertainment and vendors</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="arrow-link" href={festival.detailsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See this year's festival details <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-article-closing-section" aria-label="Closing reflection">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="blog-article-closing">
        <p>What each of these Valley Center favorites has in common is that it has become part of how I think about this community. One is new, one has been part of our family's life for years, and one is a tradition we look forward to every fall.</p>
        <p>They're very different pieces of the community, but in their own ways, they're all part of what makes this feel like home.</p>
        <p>I've already got a few more Valley Center favorites in mind for another day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-guide-bridge" aria-labelledby="valley-guide-title">
    <div class="shell blog-guide-bridge-inner" data-reveal="up">
      <h2 id="valley-guide-title">Curious about Valley Center?</h2>
      <p>My Valley Center guide shares more about the community and a few practical things to consider if you're thinking about a move.</p>
      <div class="blog-guide-actions">
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/communities/valley-center/">Explore the Valley Center guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button blog-contact-link" href="/contact/">Ask Charity about Valley Center</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BlogPostLayout>
